  "instructions": [
    "heat the chicken broth in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "add the onion, garlic, chili powder, and cumin to the pot and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "add the chipotle peppers, hominy, and feta cheese to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "reduce heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "serve hot, garnished with chopped cilantro, lime wedges, and tortilla strips.",
